 (up to approximately 35 months)","groups":[{"id":"OG000","title":"Sintilimab","description":"Sintilimab 200mg Intravenously every 3 weeks"},{"id":"OG001","title":"Docetaxel","description":"Docetaxel 75mg/m2 Intravenously every 3 weeks"}],"denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"145"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"135"}]}],"classes":[{"categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"4.3","lowerLimit":"4.04","upperLimit":"5.78"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"2.79","lowerLimit":"1.91","upperLimit":"3.19"}]}]}]},{"type":"SECONDARY","title":"Overall Response Rate (ORR) Per RECIST v1.1 as Assessed by Investigators","description":"ORR was defined as the percentage of participants in the analysis population who had a confirmed Complete Response (CR: Disappearance of all target lesions) or a Partial Response (PR: ≥30% decrease in the sum of diameters of target lesions, taking as reference the baseline sum diameters) per RECIST 1.1. The percentage of participants who experienced a CR or PR is presented.","populationDescription":"All randomized participants excluding participants in the docetaxel arm who initiated immunotherapy before receiving docetaxel or disease progression.","reportingStatus":"POSTED","paramType":"NUMBER","dispersionType":"95% Confidence Interval","unitOfMeasure":"Percentage of participants","timeFrame":"Through database cutoff date of 31-July-2020 (up to approximately 35 months)","groups":[{"id":"OG000","title":"Sintilimab","description":"Sintilimab 200mg Intravenously every 3 weeks"},{"id":"OG001","title":"Docetaxel","description":"Docetaxel 75mg/m2 Intravenously every 3 weeks"}],"denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"145"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"135"}]}],"classes":[{"categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"25.5","lowerLimit":"18.6","upperLimit":"33.4"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"2.2","lowerLimit":"0.5","upperLimit":"6.4"}]}]}]},{"type":"SECONDARY","title":"Dur